# A separate cloned repo that happens to live in this folder. It carries its own
# .git and a bundled chromedriver.exe; committing it would swallow a foreign
# project into this history.
Autogenerate-admission/

# NOTE: extension/lib/ is deliberately NOT ignored, although it IS build output
# from tools/build_extension.py.
#
# The extension is installed by copying the folder onto hospital workstations
# that cannot run python or git, so extension/ has to be a complete, directly
# loadable unpacked extension. Committing the copies is what makes that possible.
#
# src/ remains the single source of truth: edit there and re-run the build
# script. Never edit extension/lib/ by hand -- the next build overwrites it.